[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25321.75, "timestamp": "07:02:01", "text": "向上。然后我得做好准备。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25325.51, "timestamp": "07:02:05", "text": "我还没准备好。你不能吗？还没准备好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25329.11, "timestamp": "07:02:09", "text": "我不能。我觉得是你。哦，你只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25332.31, "timestamp": "07:02:12", "text": "选择设备之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25334.39, "timestamp": "07:02:14", "text": "好的。哦，所以我们就在想谁会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25335.99, "timestamp": "07:02:15", "text": "带上相机，谁来拿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25338.31, "timestamp": "07:02:18", "text": "电磁场读数器？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25342.468, "timestamp": "07:02:22", "text": "啊，电磁场。所以，EMF读取器就是EMF，呃，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25345.27, "timestamp": "07:02:25", "text": "嗯，你知道，辐射"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25348.07, "timestamp": "07:02:28", "text": "幽灵般的叶子。所以，越是这样……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25351.99, "timestamp": "07:02:31", "text": "就像说得对，我觉得我们越接近就越……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25354.39, "timestamp": "07:02:34", "text": "是或类似的东西。是的。致幽灵。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25358.628, "timestamp": "07:02:38", "text": "我想我们应该带个手电筒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25361.83, "timestamp": "07:02:41", "text": "手电筒，是的，因为它会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25368.788, "timestamp": "07:02:48", "text": "是H。是的，我想你怎么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25372.07, "timestamp": "07:02:52", "text": "我该如何购买？我没钱。什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25375.27, "timestamp": "07:02:55", "text": "是的。哦，只是为了多买点东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25376.868, "timestamp": "07:02:56", "text": "东西。我觉得你就是个普通小孩。"}]